WEBVTT

00:10:29.516 --> 00:10:30.516
(Tawa kecil)

00:10:30.556 --> 00:10:31.996
coba dan tanyakan dia,

00:10:32.036 --> 00:10:34.956
“Menurutmu bagaimana kita harus
menyelesaikan krisis iklim?”

00:10:34.996 --> 00:10:37.436
Kemungkinannya, dia akan berkata,

00:10:37.476 --> 00:10:41.436
“Jawabannya, kawanku,
benar-benar bertiup di udara.”

00:10:41.476 --> 00:10:42.636
(Tawa)

00:10:42.636 --> 00:10:43.796
Terima kasih.

00:10:43.836 --> 00:10:45.396
(Tepuk tangan)

00:10:45.436 --> 00:10:48.796
[Ambil tindakan terhadap perubahan iklim
di countdown.ted.com]